{#
  The final settlement (§6.21), moved as it was from the stay page to
  « Facture » (#708, IT-18): its own lines — consumptions, decided
  incidents, the security deposit — which never change the agreed price.

  Requires `asset`, `booking`, `settlements`, `final_persons`, `preview`,
  `decided_incidents` and `inventory_url` (null where the asset keeps no
  inventory page). Optional: `gesture`, the « Geste commercial » line of the
  latest version, carried into the form (issue #927); `pending_incident_url`,
  the oldest incident still assessed, and `outdated_settlement_ids`, the
  versions computed from other decisions — neither validates (#980).
#}
<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5 mb-2">Décompte final</h2>
        <p class="text-body-secondary small">
            Le décompte a ses propres lignes. <strong>Il ne modifie jamais le prix convenu</strong> :
            celui-ci reste le témoin de ce qui a été négocié.
        </p>

        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-sm">
                <caption class="visually-hidden">Aperçu du décompte final</caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">Ligne</th>
                        <th scope="col" class="text-end">Montant</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for line in preview.lines %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                {{ line.label }}
                                {% if line.detail %}
                                    <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">{{ line.detail }}</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                            <td class="text-end">{{ line.amountCents|money_cents }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                    <tr class="fw-semibold">
                        <td>Total</td>
                        <td class="text-end">{{ preview.total_cents|money_cents }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Solde {{ preview.balance_cents < 0 ? 'à rembourser' : 'restant dû' }}</td>
                        <td class="text-end">
                            {{ preview.balance_cents|abs|money_cents }}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {#
                      With the booking's single receivable the balance
                      already nets the deposit out (issue #927): a refund
                      names the deposit inside it, never as a second sum
                      to add. Without one the deposit is held by hand,
                      beside the balance, and keeps its own row.
                    #}
                    {% if preview.paid_includes_security_deposit|default(false) %}
                        {# Only a deposit actually held is named: overpaid rent
                           given back is not « la caution ». #}
                        {% if preview.balance_cents < 0
                            and preview.security_deposit_held_cents|default(0) > 0
                            and preview.security_deposit_return_cents > 0 %}
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="2" class="text-body-secondary small">
                                    dont la caution à rendre :
                                    {{ min(preview.security_deposit_return_cents, preview.security_deposit_held_cents,
                                        -preview.balance_cents)|money_cents }}
                                    {%- if preview.security_deposit_withheld_cents %}
                                        ({{ preview.security_deposit_withheld_cents|money_cents }} retenus)
                                    {%- endif %}
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        {% endif %}
                    {% elseif preview.security_deposit_return_cents or preview.security_deposit_withheld_cents %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>Caution à restituer</td>
                            <td class="text-end">
                                {{ preview.security_deposit_return_cents|money_cents }}
                                {% if preview.security_deposit_withheld_cents %}
                                    <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">
                                        dont {{ preview.security_deposit_withheld_cents|money_cents }}
                                        retenus
                                    </span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                </tfoot>
            </table>
        </div>

        {#
      The amounts decided on « État des lieux », read only here: the
      settlement takes them as they were decided, and the decision is
      changed where it was made.
    #}
    {% if decided_incidents is not empty %}
        <h3 class="h6">Incidents tranchés</h3>
        <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-2" data-decided-incidents>
            {% for incident in decided_incidents %}
                <li class="d-flex justify-content-between gap-2 border-bottom py-1">
                    <span>
                        {{ incident.description }}
                        <span class="text-body-secondary d-block">{{ incident.decision.label }}</span>
                    </span>
                    {% if incident.decision.value == 'charge' %}
                        <span class="text-end text-nowrap">{{ (incident.decidedAmountCents ?? 0)|money_cents }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        {% if inventory_url %}
            <p class="small"><a href="{{ inventory_url }}">Changer une décision sur l'état des lieux</a></p>
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

    <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/decompte" class="row g-2 align-items-end mb-3">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="booking_page" value="invoice">
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                <label class="form-label" for="final-persons">Participants réels</label>
                <input type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="final-persons"
                       name="final_persons" value="{{ final_persons }}">
            </div>
            {# A discount granted after the stay: a negative line of the
               settlement, never a change to the agreed price (issue #927). #}
            <div class="col-6 col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label" for="gesture-label">Geste commercial</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="gesture-label" name="gesture_label"
                       maxlength="120" placeholder="Geste commercial"
                       value="{{ gesture ? gesture.label : '' }}">
            </div>
            <div class="col-6 col-md-2">
                <label class="form-label" for="gesture-amount">Montant déduit (€)</label>
                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="gesture-amount" name="gesture_amount"
                       inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="gesture-amount-help"
                       value="{{ gesture ? (gesture.amountCents|abs / 100)|number_format(2, ',', '') : '' }}">
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-3">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary w-100">
                    Enregistrer un décompte
                </button>
            </div>
            {# Below the row, never under one control of a horizontal form. #}
            <p class="col-12 form-text mb-0" id="gesture-amount-help">
                Le geste commercial est déduit du décompte, au plus de son total.
            </p>
        </form>

        {% if settlements is not empty %}
            <h3 class="h6">Versions</h3>
            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                {% for settlement in settlements %}
                    <li class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 border-bottom py-2">
                        <span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold">v{{ settlement.version }}</span>
                            — {{ settlement.totalCents|money_cents }}
                            <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">
                                {{ settlement.createdAt|date_fr }}
                                {% if settlement.finalPersons is not null %}
                                    · {{ settlement.finalPersons }} participants
                                {% endif %}
                            </span>
                        </span>
                        {% if settlement.isValidated %}
                            {% include 'partials/status_badge.html.twig' with { status: 'done', label: 'Validé' } only %}
                        {% elseif pending_incident_url|default(null) %}
                            {# A damage still assessed holds the settlement (#980):
                               the sentence says why, the link leads to it. #}
                            <span class="small text-body-secondary text-end" data-settlement-waits="assessment">
                                Un dégât est en cours d'évaluation : le décompte se valide une fois l'incident
                                tranché.
                                <a href="{{ pending_incident_url }}">Voir l'incident</a>
                            </span>
                        {% elseif settlement.id in outdated_settlement_ids|default([]) %}
                            <span class="small text-body-secondary text-end" data-settlement-waits="outdated">
                                Ce décompte ne reflète pas les incidents tels qu'ils sont tranchés : enregistrez-en
                                un nouveau pour le valider.
                            </span>
                        {% else %}
                            <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/decompte-valider"
                                  data-confirm="{{ 'Valider ce décompte ? Il ne pourra plus être modifié, '
                                      ~ 'et la créance passe au montant conservé. Aucun e-mail n\'est envoyé.' }}">
                                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                                <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="booking_page" value="invoice">
                                <input type="hidden" name="settlement_id" value="{{ settlement.id }}">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">
                                    Valider
                                </button>
                            </form>
                        {% endif %}
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>
